        "### Download the index\n",
        "\n",
        "<!-- No dedicated Font Awesome icon exists for Stata specifically, so\n",
        "     it uses a generic file icon rather than a format-specific one. -->\n",
        "- [Excel (.xlsx)](/data/2025/output/index_2025.xlsx)\n",
        "- [CSV (.csv)](/data/2025/output/index_2025.csv)\n",
        "- [Stata (.dta)](/data/2025/output/index_2025.dta)\n",
        "\n",
        "### Missing observations\n",
        "\n",
        "A blank cell means no `POP`, `PIP`, `PEP`, or `POP_R` value is available for\n",
        "that country-year. A common reason is missing `POP_R` data for \"independent\"\n",
        "presidents not affiliated with a political party covered by V-Party.\n",
        "\n",
        "- [Download missing-observations report (.xlsx)](/data/2025/output/missing_data_2025.xlsx)\n",
